ural, technical and engineering consultancy, property management, sales and marketing, and credit administration services. The company was formerly known as ML Global Berhad and changed its name to MGB Berhad in January 2018. The company is headquartered in Petaling Jaya, Malaysia. MGB Berhad is a subsidiary of LBS Bina Group Berhad.","zh":"MGB Berhad 是一家投资控股公司，在马来西亚从事建筑和房地产开发活动，前身为 ML Global Berhad，于2018年1月更名为 MGB Berhad，总部位于马来西亚八打灵再也，是 LBS Bina Group Berhad 的子公司。","lines":["建筑与贸易：从事设计建造、土木工程、一般建筑和打桩活动，交易建筑材料，并制造工业化建筑系统预制产品。","房地产开发：开发住宅和商业物业，并建造住宅建筑。","建材制造与安装：制造、供应和安装钢铁相关建筑材料。","水务与能源设施：建造水库和水处理设施，并运营发电设施生产电能。","专业服务：提供管理、土地与产业、建筑、技术与工程咨询、物业管理、销售与营销以及信贷管理服务。"],"lines_en":["Construction and Trading: Engages in design and build, civil engineering, general construction, and piling activities; trades construction materials; and manufactures industrialized building system precast products.","Property Development: Develops residential and commercial properties and constructs residential buildings.","Steel Building Materials: Manufactures, supplies, and installs steel-related building materials.","Water and Energy Facilities: Constructs reservoir and water treatment facilities and operates generation facilities that produce electric energy.","Professional Services: Offers management, land and estates, architectural, technical and engineering consultancy, property management, sales and marketing, and credit administration services."]}}